dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]procs_filter.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202608/procs_filter.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-s9[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-s9/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Bare boolean flags and host bound keys in the shared flat [/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]grammar[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]grammar[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]grammar: teach the shared profile-driven flat query grammar two closed, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]digest-stable extensions -- a bare `key` shorthand for boolean fields [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and a host registry of directional date/duration bound keys -- across [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the flat parser, canonicalizer, value normalizer, evaluator, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]highlighter.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Procs query profile and row adapter[/bold #D7AFFF]                           [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]dialect[dim] · [dim][/dim]after grammar[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]dialect: author the `procs` query schema, the `ObservedProc` -> [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]query-row adapter with its bounded, version-keyed searchable-text cache,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and a small pure facade the pane (and any future CLI) calls to parse and[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]evaluate a proc query.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Procs filter bar widget and Admin Center key integration[/bold #D7AFFF]      [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]bar[dim] · [dim][/dim]after dialect[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]bar: add the `ProcsFilterBar` FilterBar subclass, a shared [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]show-while-active resting mode, bare-flag completion candidates, an [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Admin Center priority-Tab hand-off hook, and the pane's filter-bar [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]styling.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Procs pane filter session[/bold #D7AFFF]                                     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]pane[dim] · [dim][/dim]after bar[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]pane: wire `/` into the Procs pane -- a filter-session mixin that [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]filters the rendered rows, keeps selection and jump hints stable, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]refreshes on output churn, honors `limit:`, and reports match counts, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]errors, and the no-match empty state.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]The `m` monitor-filter cycle[/bold #D7AFFF]                                  [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]monitor[dim] · [dim][/dim]after pane[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]monitor: add a shared quote-aware flag-token toggle helper and bind `m` [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]to cycle the monitor filter through on, inverted, and off, opening and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]dismissing the query bar as the query gains and loses its last term.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Mirror the shared grammar extensions in sase-core[/bold #D7AFFF]             [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]rust[dim] · [dim][/dim]after grammar[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]rust: port the bare-boolean shorthand and the host bound-key registry [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]into the `sase-core` Rust flat parser, canonicalizer, and evaluator so [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]both implementations of the shared grammar stay byte-identical.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  7 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Documentation, visual snapshot, and copy review[/bold #D7AFFF]               [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]polish[dim] · [dim][/dim]after monitor[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]polish: document the proc query dialect in the ACE Procs Tab reference, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]add a PNG snapshot of the filtered pane, and do a final pass over hint [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]text, placeholder copy, and error wording.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-s9","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.5","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-s9.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-f918834c36016fb06512051293e921ab","started_at":"2026-08-23T12:03:19.616330+00:00","state":"completed"}],"schema_version":2,"structural_ancestors":["bbugyi200.athena.sase-s9","bbugyi200.athena.sase-s9.1","bbugyi200.athena.sase-s9.2","bbugyi200.athena.sase-s9.3","bbugyi200.athena.sase-s9.4","bbugyi200.athena.sase-s9.5","bbugyi200.athena.sase-s9.6","bbugyi200.athena.sase-s9.7","bbugyi200.athena.sase-s9.land"]}
